import{_ as e,o as a,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 571 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Dao-Principles Condensation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 571 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Dao-Principles Condensation","no":571,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Dao-Origin Realm","Dao-Principle Condensation","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0571_模块3-加速域-道元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0571_模块3-加速域-道元境适配.md"}'),n={name:"en/0571_模块3-加速域-道元境适配.md"};function r(s,i,l,c,d,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-571-acceleration-domain-dao-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-dao-principles-condensation" tabindex="-1">Entry 571 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Dao-Principles Condensation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-571-acceleration-domain-dao-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-dao-principles-condensation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 571 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Dao-Principles Condensation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 21; Benchmark library: Entry 570</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-leap-from-reading-law-to-establishing-a-dao-principle" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the leap from &quot;reading law&quot; to &quot;establishing a Dao-Principle&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-leap-from-reading-law-to-establishing-a-dao-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the leap from &quot;reading law&quot; to &quot;establishing a Dao-Principle&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-Origin lets the cultivator read law&#39;s original text; Dao-Origin requires him in his own consciousness to <strong>condense a Dao-Principle belonging to himself</strong> (Document 14). The so-called Dao-Principle is not law itself, but the cultivator&#39;s personalized understanding, application principle, and behavioral code of some law — it is the self-legislation of &quot;how I will use this law.&quot; A Law-Origin cultivator of Fire Law, upon reaching Dao-Origin must answer: what do I burn with fire, what not, why burn, to what degree burn. Once this answer solidifies in consciousness, it is his Dao-Principle.</p><p>Six top-level axioms enter the core in Dao-Origin: anti-predation axiom requires the Dao-Principle be a &quot;symbiotic Dao-Principle,&quot; may not write &quot;predation is justice&quot; into one&#39;s Dao; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Dao-Principles coexist equally, forbidding one lineage&#39;s Dao-Principle lording over others; collective ascension axiom requires Dao-Principles ultimately serve Myriad Ranks&#39; ascension, not personal flight; causal self-discipline axiom requires once a Dao-Principle is wrongly established, there must be a correction mechanism; law-first axiom takes &quot;Dao-Origin adapted flow&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-dao-principle-condensation-needs-half-fast-half-slow" tabindex="-1">I. Why Dao-Principle Condensation Needs &quot;Half-Fast Half-Slow&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-dao-principle-condensation-needs-half-fast-half-slow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Dao-Principle Condensation Needs &quot;Half-Fast Half-Slow&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Principle condensation is a composite task: half is information integration (piecing together law understandings read in Law-Origin into a self-consistent system), half is personality legislation (internalizing the system into &quot;I am this kind of person&quot;). The former suits acceleration; the latter does not.</p><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain therefore designs a <strong>two-stage flow</strong> for Dao-Origin:</p><ul><li><strong>Dao-Principle Draft Stage</strong>: 100× flow, use the acceleration domain to quickly integrate law understandings, write multiple Dao-Principle drafts;</li><li><strong>Dao-Principle Legislation Stage</strong>: 1× real flow, use months to years in real life to test drafts, confirming it truly fits one&#39;s personality.</li></ul><p>This is in the same line as Condensed-Origin&#39;s &quot;fast trial-and-error slow solidification,&quot; but more emphasizes legislation&#39;s solemnity: once a Dao-Principle solidifies in consciousness, it becomes the underlying code for all the cultivator&#39;s future behavior; if wrong, harder to fix than a wrong inner circuit.</p><h2 id="ii-dao-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Dao-Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-dao-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Dao-Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Flow</th><th>Output</th><th>Exit Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Draft Integration</td><td>100×</td><td>3–7 Dao-Principle drafts</td><td>Drafts logically self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Real-Life Test</td><td>1×</td><td>Test records</td><td>Draft does not collapse in real conflict</td></tr><tr><td>Dao-Principle Solidification</td><td>50×</td><td>Formal Dao-Principle</td><td>Alaya Network review passes</td></tr><tr><td>Dao-Principle Publication</td><td>Public</td><td>Myriad-Rank review</td><td>No objections during publication period</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Especially noteworthy is the &quot;Dao-Principle publication&quot; step: the cultivator&#39;s Dao-Principle after solidification must be published to Myriad Ranks, accept review. This is not formalism, but causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s direct manifestation — your Dao-Principle will affect how you use power in the future; Myriad Ranks have the right to know what it is before you use it.</p><h2 id="iii-symbiotic-dao-principle-s-review-standards" tabindex="-1">III. Symbiotic Dao-Principle&#39;s Review Standards <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-symbiotic-dao-principle-s-review-standards" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Symbiotic Dao-Principle&#39;s Review Standards&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Alaya Network has a set of automatic review standards for Dao-Principle drafts, three core articles:</p><ol><li><strong>No predation</strong>: the Dao-Principle may not contain clauses such as &quot;using devouring others as the evolutionary path&quot;;</li><li><strong>No monopoly</strong>: the Dao-Principle may not contain clauses such as &quot;claiming law knowledge as private property&quot;;</li><li><strong>No exclusion</strong>: the Dao-Principle may not contain clauses such as &quot;some race naturally inferior to others.&quot;</li></ol><p>Any one failing, the draft must be sent back for rewriting. This standard directly compiles the six top-level axioms into a Dao-Principle review algorithm — the cultivator wants to secretly stuff predation logic into his Dao? The algorithm is the first to refuse.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-heresy-dao-principles" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Heresy Dao-Principles&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-heresy-dao-principles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Heresy Dao-Principles&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, Dao-Principle condensation is completely private: the strong legislate in closed-door cultivation, use it as established, no one governs. Thus history saw countless &quot;heresy Dao-Principles&quot; — proving the Dao by killing, by devouring, by world-destruction. These Dao-Principles may be self-consistent at the personal level, but at the civilizational level are disasters.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution is not to forbid cultivators from legislating, but to place legislative power within Myriad-Rank co-governance framework: you may establish your Dao, but your Dao must withstand Myriad-Rank review, must conform to the five axioms, must leave traces on the Alaya Network. This is not suppressing individuality, but making individuality compatible with symbiosis.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: draft-stage high-multiple acceleration, legislation-stage real flow, avoiding compressing personality legislation into a consciousness game</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Dao-Principle review algorithm automatically identifies predatory clauses, eliminating heresy Dao-Principles at the source</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Dao-Principle relies on protagonist&#39;s comprehension self-enlightenment; if wrong no one corrects; Heng Yuan&#39;s Dao-Principle must be published to Myriad Ranks; if wrong someone corrects</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have Dao-Principle templates; plant spirits&#39; &quot;Growth Dao-Principle,&quot; planet consciousness&#39;s &quot;Balance Dao-Principle&quot; also published</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Dao-Principle draft library, review algorithm, publication records all public; this is the high-tier segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-dynamic-revision-mechanism-after-dao-principle-solidification" tabindex="-1">VI. Dynamic Revision Mechanism After Dao-Principle Solidification <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-dynamic-revision-mechanism-after-dao-principle-solidification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Dynamic Revision Mechanism After Dao-Principle Solidification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Principles after publication are not unchanging. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization designs a periodic review mechanism for solidified Dao-Principles: each time a cultivator experiences a major life turning point — helping others, erring, losing, bearing responsibility — he should proactively return to the Alaya Network, apply for a minor revision of his Dao-Principle. The revision process is the same as first legislation: draft-stage acceleration, real-life test, Myriad-Rank publication. This mechanism turns the Dao-Principle from a once-and-for-all manifesto into a living law that grows with life. In the predatory-faction system, the strong one&#39;s Dao-Principle once established never changes for life, even if long disconnected from reality; Heng Yuan Zhou allows Dao-Principles to grow with the cultivator; this is precisely the law-first axiom&#39;s true understanding of coherence — coherence is not unchanging, but able to maintain logical closure amid change.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Origin is the key realm from &quot;understanding the universe&quot; to &quot;defining how one treats the universe.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain here gives him efficiency to quickly integrate drafts, yet hands final legislative power back to real time and Myriad-Rank review. A Dao-Principle able to withstand publication is a Dao-Principle truly worthy of Origin Realm and higher realms.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./570_模块3-加速域-法元境适配.html">570-Acceleration-Domain Law-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=e(n,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
